      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} Well, the thing that it selects the Quest version first instead of PC happens on some avatars that are on the same project.\n\nAnd the infinite loop: Start the multiupload starting from PC, then cancel it during the Android or iOS upload, and without going back to Unity's PC target, start the upload again with the PC Version selected in the Selected Avatar dropdown. For me it sometimes gets stuck in an infinite loop then.",
