  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometimes when doing the Multi Platform upload, the SDK can sometimes upload the Quest version on PC instead of correctly uploading the PC version to PC.\n\nIt started since the SDK started having multiplatform overrides. \n\nPlus sometimes the SDK selects the Quest version first, forcing me to change it to PC version so that it will upload correctly despite having the overrides set.",
